{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And YHWH Elohim caused a deep sleep to fall upon the man.</b> So that he would not be frightened nor distressed." "<b>And He took one of his ribs.</b> Because He had already gathered his dust and selected the choicest of all that was fit to be the matter for his vital form, therefore when He wished to form the form of the female — who is nearly similar to him — it was fitting to take some of his matter, namely one of his ribs."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:42.153985718Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}